    <item>
      <title>Republicans Don’t Need a New Playbook. They Need Conservatism</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-10/republicans-don-t-need-a-new-playbook-they-need-conservatism</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">7ba52fd8bde0319b698110d2</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 12:30:05 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Never in my lifetime has there been an easier political post-mortem. It’s obvious what caused the GOP’s midterm wipeout. The harder question for Republicans is what comes next. And no, it’s not just ending the war in Iran — although that would help.</description>
