      <title>South Africa Needs Its Coalition Government to Succeed</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-10/south-africa-needs-its-coalition-government-to-succeed</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">4514ee007407654deb09629c</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 04:00:06 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>In South Africa’s municipal elections last week, the African National Congress suffered its most crushing rejection by the electorate since democracy dawned in 1994. President Cyril Ramaphosa should nevertheless resist pressure to abandon his business-friendly unity government and instead expand the coalition template across local administrations.</description>
